e on missing transcript path (no silent SilentError)\n/tmp/entire-export session info nonexistent --transcript 2>/tmp/err >/tmp/out\ngrep . /tmp/err\n# → \"Session not found.\" (visible, not swallowed)\n```\n\n---\n\n**Checkpoint explain — JSON list / single**\n\n```bash\n# List view: array of branch checkpoints, no transcript bytes anywhere\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain --json | jq 'length'\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain --json | jq '.[0]'\n# → keys: checkpoint_id, session_id, agent, date, message, …\n\n# List view filtered by session id prefix (mirrors prose --session)\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain --json --session \"$SID\" | jq length\n\n# Single-checkpoint envelope (committed metadata only)\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain \"$CID\" --json | jq .\n# → top: checkpoint_id, session_count, sessions[]\n# → each session: index, session_id, agent, model, token_usage, summary\n# → NO transcript / raw_transcript / compact_transcript fields.\n\n# Per-session error field (Claude A): expect empty `error` for healthy reads\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain \"$CID\" --json | jq '.sessions[].error // \"(ok)\"'\n# → \"(ok)\" for each session.\n\n# Positional commit SHA falls back to commit-ref resolution (Codex 1)\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain \"$SHA\" --json | jq .checkpoint_id\n# → resolved checkpoint id (extracted from the commit's Entire-Checkpoint trailer)\n\n# Explicit --commit form still works\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain --commit \"$SHA\" --json | jq .checkpoint_id\n```\n\nConfirm the JSON contract — never embed transcript bytes:\n```bash\n# Should match nothing (no embedded transcript)\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain \"$CID\" --json | grep -E '\"(raw_)?transcript\"|\"compact_transcript\"' || echo \"OK: no transcript in JSON\"\n```\n\n---\n\n**Checkpoint explain — transcript streams**\n\n```bash\n# Compact (normalized) transcript for the latest session\n/tmp/entire-export checkpoint explain \"$CID\" --transcr